44
00:02:33,720 --> 00:02:35,540
It is, you know, when I grew up in church,

45
00:02:35,540 --> 00:02:36,900
the only spiritual disciplines there were

46
00:02:36,900 --> 00:02:38,880
were prayer and Bible reading.

47
00:02:38,880 --> 00:02:41,780
There's so much more to the Christian faith than that.

48
00:02:41,820 --> 00:02:43,600
And out of that, we talked about things

49
00:02:43,600 --> 00:02:44,560
that happened because of that.

50
00:02:44,560 --> 00:02:46,300
But service is a discipline

51
00:02:46,300 --> 00:02:48,500
that we choose to do as Christians.

52
00:02:48,500 --> 00:02:50,680
And it's a discipline at the very intersection

53
00:02:50,680 --> 00:02:53,660
of loving God with all of your heart, soul, mind,

54
00:02:53,660 --> 00:02:56,000
and strength and loving your neighbor as yourself.

55
00:02:56,000 --> 00:02:58,000
And so my hope and prayer

56
00:02:58,000 --> 00:02:59,060
throughout these next four weeks

57
00:02:59,060 --> 00:03:01,760
is that we keep our eyes focused on that intersection

58
00:03:01,760 --> 00:03:04,040
of loving God and loving our neighbor

59
00:03:04,040 --> 00:03:06,640
because service is something that can easily happen

60
00:03:06,640 --> 00:03:08,280
just focused on loving our neighbor

61
00:03:08,280 --> 00:03:11,800
and forgetting about the root of God's love for us.

62
00:03:12,540 --> 00:03:14,320
So this morning, we're gonna continue this series

63
00:03:14,320 --> 00:03:17,220
by looking at one of the most profound acts of service

64
00:03:17,220 --> 00:03:20,000
recorded for us from the life of Jesus.

65
00:03:20,000 --> 00:03:22,360
Let's pray and we'll get started.

66
00:03:22,360 --> 00:03:24,040
Father in heaven,

67
00:03:24,040 --> 00:03:30,880
thank you for your example.

68
00:03:30,880 --> 00:03:34,860
Thank you for sending Jesus, the incarnate one,

69
00:03:34,960 --> 00:03:37,380
who can model for us what it looks like

70
00:03:37,380 --> 00:03:39,180
to follow you with flesh and blood,

71
00:03:39,180 --> 00:03:43,200
with dirty feet and calloused hands.

72
00:03:43,200 --> 00:03:48,960
You didn't just send us your word from heaven,

73
00:03:48,960 --> 00:03:50,540
but you sent us your son

74
00:03:50,540 --> 00:03:53,400
who became word in the flesh,

75
00:03:53,400 --> 00:03:54,920
dwelt among us.

76
00:03:54,920 --> 00:03:58,040
God, may we look to him as our example this morning.

77
00:03:58,040 --> 00:04:00,100
May we learn from his example.

78
00:04:01,300 --> 00:04:03,580
May we be reminded of the love

79
00:04:03,580 --> 00:04:07,400
that the incarnation truly is towards us.

80
00:04:07,400 --> 00:04:11,060
God, we need you to remind us

81
00:04:11,060 --> 00:04:12,380
of how much we are loved,

82
00:04:12,380 --> 00:04:14,640
how much we are forgiven,

83
00:04:14,640 --> 00:04:16,900
of how much grace is available to us.

84
00:04:16,900 --> 00:04:20,640
Speak to us today by your Holy Spirit

85
00:04:20,640 --> 00:04:23,080
for your glory and for our good

86
00:04:23,080 --> 00:04:23,980
and for the good of our neighbor.

87
00:04:23,980 --> 00:04:27,300
It's in Jesus' name I pray, amen.

