It is a hyperbolic satire,

101
00:04:57,600 --> 00:04:59,720
and so just try and stick with me for just a second.

102
00:04:59,720 --> 00:05:02,340
In season four, episode one,

103
00:05:02,340 --> 00:05:04,800
Michael Scott hits one of his employees

104
00:05:04,800 --> 00:05:07,880
named Meredith Palmer in the parking lot

105
00:05:07,880 --> 00:05:10,800
with his vehicle as he is riding into work.

106
00:05:10,800 --> 00:05:13,500
And he hits her in the car,

107
00:05:13,500 --> 00:05:14,460
he hits her with his car,

108
00:05:14,460 --> 00:05:16,400
and then he helps her get to the hospital,

109
00:05:16,400 --> 00:05:19,180
and it's at the hospital when the office finds out

110
00:05:19,180 --> 00:05:20,820
that she may have rabies.

111
00:05:22,180 --> 00:05:24,580
Yes, so bad day turns to worse.

112
00:05:24,580 --> 00:05:26,320
She gets hit by a car in the parking lot,

113
00:05:26,320 --> 00:05:28,420
