638
00:26:51,660 --> 00:26:51,980
Like, well,

639
00:26:51,980 --> 00:26:52,880
if God would just show up

640
00:26:52,880 --> 00:26:53,600
and tell me he's real,

641
00:26:53,600 --> 00:26:54,180
I'd believe him.

642
00:26:54,180 --> 00:26:58,140
It's like us loving people sacrificially

643
00:26:58,140 --> 00:26:59,440
is God showing up

644
00:26:59,440 --> 00:27:00,860
and telling people that he's real.

645
00:27:00,860 --> 00:27:02,440
Us doing the thing

646
00:27:02,440 --> 00:27:04,180
that doesn't make any cultural sense.

647
00:27:04,180 --> 00:27:05,380
Us saying no

648
00:27:05,380 --> 00:27:07,660
to all of the cultural realities

649
00:27:07,660 --> 00:27:08,240
that are like,

650
00:27:08,240 --> 00:27:08,900
don't do that.

651
00:27:08,900 --> 00:27:09,920
This is above you.

652
00:27:09,920 --> 00:27:10,980
This is beyond you.

653
00:27:10,980 --> 00:27:12,300
You are too important for this.

654
00:27:12,300 --> 00:27:13,460
You are too valuable for this.

655
00:27:13,460 --> 00:27:15,280
If we step out beyond that

656
00:27:15,280 --> 00:27:16,820
and we serve those in need,

657
00:27:16,820 --> 00:27:17,720
it is a parable

658
00:27:17,720 --> 00:27:19,080
that preaches the gospel

659
00:27:19,080 --> 00:27:20,540
that demonstrates God's love

660
00:27:20,540 --> 00:27:22,260
to others around us.

661
00:27:22,260 --> 00:27:25,620
Now that you know these things,

662
00:27:25,620 --> 00:27:27,620
once you get them in your bones,

663
00:27:27,620 --> 00:27:29,160
once you understand them fully,

664
00:27:29,160 --> 00:27:31,800
blessed are you if you do them.

665
00:27:31,800 --> 00:27:33,520
It's the second thing

666
00:27:33,520 --> 00:27:34,220
that I think Jesus'

667
00:27:34,220 --> 00:27:37,020
lived parable does for us.

668
00:27:37,020 --> 00:27:38,140
It teaches us

669
00:27:38,140 --> 00:27:39,480
and it equips us

670
00:27:39,480 --> 00:27:41,760
to go out and do the thing

671
00:27:41,760 --> 00:27:43,240
