672
00:27:43,240 --> 00:27:44,180
And if we're gonna do it,

673
00:27:44,180 --> 00:27:45,920
we have to learn it first.

674
00:27:45,920 --> 00:27:46,760
The parable is a way

675
00:27:46,760 --> 00:27:47,580
of teaching a truth

676
00:27:47,580 --> 00:27:49,160
that we already know.

677
00:27:49,960 --> 00:27:51,760
Just like Jesus served his disciples

678
00:27:51,760 --> 00:27:52,880
to show them

679
00:27:52,880 --> 00:27:53,940
how much God loves them,

680
00:27:53,940 --> 00:27:55,600
we are invited to serve others

681
00:27:55,600 --> 00:27:57,620
because we have come to know

682
00:27:57,620 --> 00:27:59,540
how much God loves us.

683
00:27:59,540 --> 00:28:02,160
And we could get in

684
00:28:02,160 --> 00:28:03,420
