685
00:28:03,420 --> 00:28:04,940
about whether this phrase,

686
00:28:04,940 --> 00:28:08,580
I have left you an example

687
00:28:08,580 --> 00:28:09,140
to follow,

688
00:28:09,140 --> 00:28:09,760
whether it means

689
00:28:09,760 --> 00:28:10,520
that you should actually

690
00:28:10,520 --> 00:28:11,500
wash each other's feet.

691
00:28:11,500 --> 00:28:13,060
That's the argument

692
00:28:13,060 --> 00:28:13,780
I get in with people

693
00:28:13,780 --> 00:28:14,540
when they don't wanna come

694
00:28:14,540 --> 00:28:15,520
to the threefold services.

695
00:28:15,520 --> 00:28:16,340
Like he doesn't mean

696
00:28:16,340 --> 00:28:17,540
actually wash people's feet.

697
00:28:17,540 --> 00:28:18,780
He means sacrificially serve.

698
00:28:18,780 --> 00:28:19,560
And I'm like, maybe.

699
00:28:19,560 --> 00:28:23,000
Maybe that's what he means.

700
00:28:23,000 --> 00:28:24,760
Or maybe he means both.

701
00:28:24,760 --> 00:28:26,100
Right?

702
00:28:26,100 --> 00:28:27,640
And I'm not gonna try

703
00:28:27,640 --> 00:28:28,780
and convince you theologically

704
00:28:28,780 --> 00:28:31,060
that you have to participate

705
00:28:31,060 --> 00:28:32,320
in a foot washing service.

706
00:28:32,320 --> 00:28:33,380
But what I'm saying is like,

707
00:28:33,380 --> 00:28:35,620
what if that's what he meant?

708
00:28:35,620 --> 00:28:37,180
What if he meant

709
00:28:37,180 --> 00:28:38,460
