729
00:29:05,760 --> 00:29:06,580
when there's nothing

730
00:29:06,580 --> 00:29:07,400
in it for us.

731
00:29:07,400 --> 00:29:12,560
Not only does it take time

732
00:29:12,560 --> 00:29:12,980
and attention

733
00:29:12,980 --> 00:29:14,380
